"Built-in: list/active/clear (see runtime skills handlers).\n"
":skills list <keyword>  Filter skills by keyword (name/description).\n"
":skills find <keyword>  Same as list with filter.\n"
"Dynamic subcommands come from tool CMD_SPEC (install, uninstall, apm, mp_search).\n"
"Use :help skills install for a subcommand."
msgstr ""
"Bawaan: daftar/aktif/hapus (lihat penangan keterampilan runtime).\n"
":skills daftar <kata kunci> Filter keterampilan berdasarkan kata kunci (nama/deskripsi).\n"
":skills temukan <kata kunci> Sama seperti daftar dengan filter.\n"
"Sub-perintah dinamis berasal dari alat CMD_SPEC (instal, hapus instalan, apm, mp_search).\n"
"Gunakan :help instalasi keterampilan untuk sub-perintah."

